sed to be** open*; *He **admitted that** he lied*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She admits ___ she made mistakes. (that)","a":"that","why":"admit that."},{"s":"She denies ___ gifts. (take, -ing)","a":"taking","why":"deny + -ing."},{"s":"She promises ___ be more open. (to)","a":"to","why":"promise to."},{"s":"A critic ___ readers not to believe everything. (warn)","a":"warns","why":"warn."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["political memoir","memórias políticas"],["ghost-written book","livro escrito por ghost-writer"],["book tour","turnê de lançamento"],["publisher’s blurb","sinopse da editora"],["rival camp","grupo rival"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["she","made","mistakes","That"],"ans":"That she made mistakes","pt":"Que cometeu erros."},{"words":["deny","anything","Does","she"],"ans":"Does she deny anything","pt":"Ela nega algo?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"political memoir","pos":"word","pt":"memórias políticas","ex":"Political memoir.","expt":"Memórias políticas."},{"w":"ghost-written book","pos":"word","pt":"livro escrito por ghost-writer","ex":"Ghost-written book.","expt":"Livro escrito por ghost-writer."},{"w":"publisher’s blurb","pos":"word","pt":"sinopse da editora","ex":"Publisher’s blurb.","expt":"Sinopse da editora."},{"w":"rival camp","pos":"word","pt":"grupo rival","ex":"Rival camp.","expt":"Grupo rival."},{"w":"spin doctor","pos":"word","pt":"assessor de imagem","ex":"Spin doctor.","expt":"Assessor de imagem."},{"w":"honest account","pos":"word","pt":"relato honesto","ex":"Honest account.","expt":"Relato honesto."},{"w":"defensive tone","pos":"word","pt":"tom defensivo","ex":"Defensive tone.","expt":"Tom defensivo."},{"w":"reviewer’s verdict","pos":"word","pt":"veredito do resenhista","ex":"Reviewer’s verdict.","