":[["I / you / we / they admit","He admits his mistake."],["he / she / it admits","Ele admite o erro."]]},{"v":"deny","pt":"negar","forms":[["I / you / we / they deny","She denies the claim."],["he / she / it denies","Ela nega a alegação."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Book talk","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Book talk","lines":[["Ana","What does the mayor admit in the book?","O que a prefeita admite no livro?"],["Leo","That she made mistakes.","Que cometeu erros."],["Ana","Does she deny anything?","Ela nega algo?"],["Leo","She denies taking gifts, and she promises to be more open.","Ela nega ter aceitado presentes e promete ser mais aberta."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Entonação de contraste, surpresa, dúvida","items":[{"label":"Entonação de contraste, surpresa, dúvida","note":"Tom desce-sobe para contraste e surpresa; sobe para dúvida: Really? ↗ I said BLUE, not green.","words":["Really?","You did?","I said blue.","Not that one.","Is that so?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Use admit that.","pt":"Use.","model":"He admitted that he was late."},{"q":"Use deny -ing.","pt":"Use.","model":"She denied taking the money."},{"q":"Use promise to.","pt":"Use.","model":"They promised to help."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences using different reporting verbs with that, -ing and to.","model":"The mayor admits that she made mistakes. She denies taking gifts. She promises to be more open. A rival claims that the book is spin. A critic warns readers not to believe every page.","checklist":["Usei **that**","Usei **-ing**","Usei **to + verbo**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “political memoir” mean?","opts":["memórias políticas","livro escrito por ghost-writer","sinopse da editora"],"ans":0